{"id":"870cd425e57e823a","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound.md","title":"LBA 的有限配置见证与 CSL 可判定性","display":"thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound — LBA 的有限配置见证与 CSL 可判定性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound","aliases":["73-thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound"],"display":"thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound — LBA 的有限配置见证与 CSL 可判定性","depends_on":["[[73-df-linear-bounded-automaton]]","[[73-thm-lba-csl-characterization]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"Theorem 9.7, p. 227; scan 235; local LBA counting argument","source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 9.7, p. 227; scan 235; local LBA counting argument","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound — LBA 的有限配置见证与 CSL 可判定性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"974813fdd45b5d4c\" href=\"?note=974813fdd45b5d4c\" title=\"73-df-linear-bounded-automaton\">73-df-linear-bounded-automaton</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f0b2b0bbfc242b92\" href=\"?note=f0b2b0bbfc242b92\" title=\"73-thm-lba-csl-characterization\">73-thm-lba-csl-characterization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Theorem 9.7, p. 227; scan 235; local LBA counting argument"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 9.7, p. 227; scan 235; local LBA counting argument"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定有效 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\">\\(B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|w|\">\\(n=|w|\\)</span>。配置、转移见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"974813fdd45b5d4c\" href=\"?note=974813fdd45b5d4c\" title=\"73-df-linear-bounded-automaton\">73-df-linear-bounded-automaton</a>；CSL 和判定类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f0b2b0bbfc242b92\" href=\"?note=f0b2b0bbfc242b92\" title=\"73-thm-lba-csl-characterization\">73-thm-lba-csl-characterization</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lba\\text{-}finite\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n|\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}|\\le |Q|(n+2)|\\Gamma|^n\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lba\\text{-}finite\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n|\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}|\\le |Q|(n+2)|\\Gamma|^n\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lba\\text{-}finite\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}w\\in L(B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}\\;[&amp;m&lt;|Q|(n+2)|\\Gamma|^n\\\\&amp;\\land\\rho(0)=(q_0,\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle,0)\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))\\in F\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\to_{B,w}\\rho(i+1)].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lba\\text{-}finite\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}w\\in L(B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}\\;[&amp;m&lt;|Q|(n+2)|\\Gamma|^n\\\\&amp;\\land\\rho(0)=(q_0,\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle,0)\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))\\in F\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\to_{B,w}\\rho(i+1)].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lba\\text{-}finite\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CSL}^{\\varepsilon}_{\\Sigma}\\subseteq\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lba\\text{-}finite\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CSL}^{\\varepsilon}_{\\Sigma}\\subseteq\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>两个端标记固定，只有 n 个内部格可变化。最短接受路径不重复配置，因此有严格的有限步数上界；枚举有限配置图及可达集就是总停机判定。原书另以有界句型图证明 CSL 可判定，机制相同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-linear-bounded-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"974813fdd45b5d4c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-linear-bounded-automaton]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-lba-csl-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"f0b2b0bbfc242b92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-lba-csl-characterization]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-linear-bounded-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"974813fdd45b5d4c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定有效 $B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)$，$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$n=|w|$。配置、转移见 [[73-df-linear-bounded-automaton]]；CSL 和判定类见 [[73-thm-lba-csl-characterization]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-lba-csl-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"f0b2b0bbfc242b92","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定有效 $B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)$，$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$n=|w|$。配置、转移见 [[73-df-linear-bounded-automaton]]；CSL 和判定类见 [[73-thm-lba-csl-characterization]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定有效 $B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)$，$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$n=|w|$。配置、转移见 [[73-df-linear-bounded-automaton]]；CSL 和判定类见 [[73-thm-lba-csl-characterization]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"n=|w|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lba\\text{-}finite\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n|\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}|\\le |Q|(n+2)|\\Gamma|^n","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lba\\text{-}finite\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}w\\in L(B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}\\;[&m<|Q|(n+2)|\\Gamma|^n\\\\&\\land\\rho(0)=(q_0,\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle,0)\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))\\in F\\\\&\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\to_{B,w}\\rho(i+1)].\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lba\\text{-}finite\\text{-}configuration\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CSL}^{\\varepsilon}_{\\Sigma}\\subseteq\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}","display":true}],"bytes":2430,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-388","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound|LBA 的有限配置见证与 CSL 可判定性]]"},{"id":"f2933d38e9d14eb7","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$|\\Sigma|\\ge3$。所有语言类都取同一 $\\Sigma$；正则、CFL、CSL 的空词扩展、可判定与可识别类分别见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]、[[73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl]]、[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]；CSL 的判定性见 [[73-thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["974813fdd45b5d4c","f0b2b0bbfc242b92","004d4e2ba3fdd14e"]}